{"id": "20467427", "revid": "753665", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20467427", "title": "Shadow Force (1992 film)", "text": "Shadow Force is a 1992 American action film directed by Ken Lamkin.\nPlot.\nIn the fictional town of Norman, close to San Antonio, the local police is composed of professional assassins. With one exception, the police chief down to the dispatcher are all on the payroll of a local racketeer who makes use of these paid killers to dispose of zealous law enforcement officials opposed to his operations. When the last remaining honorable member of the force (Glenn Corbett) is killed, his brother-in-law (Dirk Benedict), a homicide detective from an unidentified city in Kansas, begins an investigation of his own."}
