{"id": "20467501", "revid": "6326132", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20467501", "title": "Ceratostoma foliatum", "text": "Ceratostoma foliatum, or leafy hornmouth is a species of medium to large sea snail, a marine gastropod mollusk in the family Muricidae, the rock snails.\nDistribution.\nThis species lives in the Eastern Pacific. \nKnown from California, West coast of North America."}
